+/*
+ * op 7: L9 as the PMIC has it (PM6125, SPMI SID 0, LDO9 at 0x4800: PMIC5 LDO STATUS1 0x08,
+ * VSET 0x40/0x41 mV, MODE_CTL 0x45, EN_CTL 0x46). Observer reads only, nothing written. (0193:
+ * an SPMI read once hung the audio thread, so this is an op of its own, never part of op 1.)
